  "benefits": {
    "type": "financial",
    "value": "A state home heating credit that reduces the household's heating costs; the actual dollar amount varies based on household size/exemptions, income/resources, rent or ownership status, and days occupied. The official materials reviewed do not present it as a fixed statewide dollar amount for everyone.",
